RELAXED_BOX 71.8573478738792 71.8578040294319 71.8577966739467

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-158.318583119479)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-158.318583119479)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
